but a moment, Great Hero?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_21","text":"Sure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_22","text":"At long last do I meet thee, Great Hero, of whom I had only heard in tales.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_23","text":"Yet so many events have arisen that","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_24","text":"I deem we have not yet discoursed as we ought.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_25","text":"Wilt thou grant me but a moment of thy time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_26","text":"It's only because you keep getting lost...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_27","text":"Ha! 'Tis but meet that thou shouldst think thus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_28","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_29","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_29","text":"I tell the others that I'll be back shortly,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_30","text":"then take a seat across from Nayuta at a suitable spot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_31","text":"What do you want to talk about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_32","text":"Haha, thou venturest straight to the matter?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_nayuta_01_33","text":"Prithee, haste thee not. Verily, all things in this world follow their ordained course.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_nayuta_01_34","type"